      "title": "Student Jobs",
      "description": "Student Jobs | SNHU Careers Skip to main content Who We Are Who We Are Culture Benefits Equity, Diversity & Inclusion Military Career Areas Career Areas Online Teaching Jobs Academics & Teaching Business Operations & Technology Campus Staff Customer Service & Student Support Human Resources & Strategy Marketing & Communications Student Jobs Working at SNHU Working at SNHU Flexible Work Training & Development How We Hire 0 My Saved Jobs Search Jobs Student Jobs Are you a student at SNHU? We want to work with you, too. Maybe you’re a sport management major learning the ins and outs of field operations on campus. Or an aspiring graphic designer working with the SNHU Marketing team from across the country. Whether you take classes online or in person, student jobs give you the opportunity to grow beyond the classroom and start building the career of your dreams — all before graduating. Jobs for students As a student worker, you'll... Gain skills in your field by bringing what you’ve learned in the classroom to the real world. Make connections by working alongside industry professionals who want to see you succeed. Build your resume by adding hands-on experience to your list of qualifications. Feel valued for what you bring to the table, while getting paid to do work that matters. What student workers are saying Working at SNHU has allowed me to network and build relationships with people in my industry. I’ve been able to work on projects that will go on my resume, find internships and figure out what I want to do in the future. Kayleigh P. Student Worker Open opportunities Check out the latest available student jobs. Student ISS Office Assistant Save Saved Student Jobs On-Site (New Hampshire) Student - Engineering Idea Lab Save Saved Student Jobs On-Site (New Hampshire) Student - Global Citizens Circle Non-Profit Database Administrator (Work-Study Only) Save Saved Student Jobs Remote See more jobs Have questions about student jobs ? If you want to 