    "https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/snhu-careers/": {
      "title": "SNHU Careers",
      "description": "SNHU Careers | LinkedIn Agree & Join LinkedIn By clicking Continue to join or sign in, you agree to LinkedIn’s User Agreement , Privacy Policy , and Cookie Policy . Sign in to see who you already know at SNHU Careers Email or phone Password Show Forgot password? Sign in Sign in with Email or New to LinkedIn? Join now By clicking Continue to join or sign in, you agree to LinkedIn’s User Agreement , Privacy Policy , and Cookie Policy . Skip to main content LinkedIn Top Content People Learning Jobs Games Sign in Join now SNHU Careers Higher Education Manchester, NH 17,052 followers At SNHU, we do life-changing work — and not just for our students. Find out how your life can change, too. Follow Report this product About us What does life-changing look like? It’s feeling like you matter, and doing something that matters. Making connections and making a difference. Looking to the future and loving what you see. When you work at SNHU, you can have it all. \n\nSNHU is a place where you can truly belong. As a distributed workforce  — many of us 100% remote  — we represent all different experiences, talents and perspectives. Beyond student-facing jobs, our staff include marketing experts, product developers, IT specialists and countless others. And the coolest part? No matter what role we play, we all get to make a difference every day.\n\nHere are some of the biggest perks of working at SNHU:\n\nDistributed workforce\nWith options to work from home in over 30 states, in-person at our New Hampshire office, or a mix of the two, we take flexibility to a whole new level.\n\n5 weeks PTO (Full-time) \nBecause we know you’ll bring your best at work when you live your best outside of it.\n\nTotal rewards\nAt SNHU, compensation goes beyond your pay. We invest in you with competitive healthcare, free tuition, employer-funded retirement plans and more.\n\nProfessional development\nWe believe in growing our people. That’s why we offer professional development funds and career coaching to help you reach your goals.\n\nAwards and distinctions:\n\n•\tRanked #17 on Forbes Best Employers for Women (2022)\n•\tAwarded the Platinum Seal for Workplace Mental Health by Mental Health America (2022)\n•\tAwarded Great College to Work For by the Chronicle of Higher Education every year since its inception\n\nReady to make a change? Check out our most recent job listings today. Website https://jobs.snhu.edu/en/ External link for SNHU Careers Industry Higher Education Company size 10,001+ employees Headquarters Manchester, NH Founded 1932 Updates SNHU Careers 17,052 followers 3d Report this post Your next role could be closer than you think. \n\nWe're expanding the way we think about what's possible, and invite you to do the same. Take a look at our current opportunities and discover what could be next: jobs.snhu.edu 27 2 Comments Like Comment Share SNHU Careers 17,052 followers 2w Report this post We're proud to once again be recognized by Forbes as one of America's Best Employers for Women. \n\nThis recognition is based on the perspective of women in the workplace, including feedback on workplace culture, career development, representation in leadership, and more. We're honored to see the experiences of women across Southern New Hampshire University reflected and remain committed to creating environments where everyone can grow, contribute, and build careers that work for their lives. 88 3 Comments Like Comment Share SNHU Careers 17,052 followers 1mo Report this post Transformation isn't just part of our mission. It's part of our culture.\n\nIt's reflected in how we learn, collaborate, and grow together every day. Discover what life at Southern New Hampshire University looks like and explore opportunities to join our team: https://jobs.snhu.edu/en/ Transform lives, including yours jobs.snhu.edu 35 2 Comments Like Comment Share SNHU Careers 17,052 followers 1mo Report this post We understand that researching companies during your job search can come with many questions. Beyond the job description, what do you wish companies shared more about during the hiring process?\n\nShare below what you'd care most about knowing before joining a new team. If there's something not listed, leave a comment and let us know! 3 1 Comment Like Comment Share SNHU Careers 17,052 followers 2mo Report this post If you're looking for your next career in IT, check out our latest remote openings! New opportunities to join our AI Engineering Team are now available. \n\nLearn all about them here: jobs.snhu.edu . View C2PA information 18 5 Comments Like Comment Share SNHU Careers 17,052 followers 2mo Report this post We're honored to be recognized by D2L with the 2026 Excellence Award for our innovative program, Advancing Equitable Student Outcomes through LMS-Enabled Faculty Development.\n\nUsing Brightspace, our Faculty Training and Development Team designed and delivered a six-week program focused on inclusive online teaching practices, equipping more than 200 adjunct faculty with tools to better support learner success and advance equitable outcomes.\n\nLearn about the program and its impact: https://lnkd.in/edkARCAh To our Faculty Training and Development Team: thank you for transforming ideas into impact and helping move our mission forward. 50 2 Comments Like Comment Share SNHU Careers 17,052 followers 3mo Report this post The best career moves don't always start with a plan. Sometimes they start with a little curiosity.\n\nIf you're curious about what's next, we've got new opportunities available. Explore them here: jobs.snhu.edu View C2PA information 48 3 Comments Like Comment Share SNHU Careers 17,052 followers 3mo Report this post Each day brings something new, which makes it important to find moments to reset and recharge.\n\nTell us, what routines help you reset during your workday? 8 Like Comment Share SNHU Careers 17,052 followers 3mo Report this post Do you believe that education can change lives? We do too. 💛 \n\nNew opportunities to join our mission are now available. Come work with us! https://jobs.snhu.edu/en/ 70 5 Comments Like Comment Share SNHU Careers reposted this Southern New Hampshire University 489,813 followers 4mo Report this post A weekend we won't forget ✨ we loved celebrating you, Class of 2026. +3 580 43 Comments Like Comment Share Join now to see what you are missing Find people you know at SNHU Careers Browse recommended jobs for you View all updates, news, and articles Join now Affiliated pages Southern New Hampshire University Higher Education Manchester, NH Similar pages USAJOBS Human Resources Services Washington, DC U.S. Department of Education Government Administration Washington, DC Western Governors University Higher Education Salt Lake City, UT Rose of Sharon Academy Education Administration Programs Nairobi , Nairobi South Westphalia University of Applied Sciences North Shore Community College Higher Education Danvers, ma Tarleton State University Higher Education Stephenville, tx Obama Foundation Non-profit Organizations Chicago, Illinois University of Pennsylvania Higher Education Philadelphia, PA Candlewick Press Book and Periodical Publishing Somerville, MA Show more similar pages Show fewer similar pages LinkedIn © 2026 About Accessibility User Agreement Privacy Policy Your California Privacy Choices Cookie Policy Copyright Policy Brand Policy Guest Controls Community Guidelines العربية (Arabic) বাংলা (Bangla) Čeština (Czech) Dansk (Danish) Deutsch (German) Ελληνικά (Greek) English (English) Español (Spanish) فارسی (Persian) Suomi (Finnish) Français (French) हिंदी (Hindi) Magyar (Hungarian) Bahasa Indonesia (Indonesian) Italiano (Italian) עברית (Hebrew) 日本語 (Japanese) 한국어 (Korean) मराठी (Marathi) Bahasa Malaysia (Malay) Nederlands (Dutch) Norsk (Norwegian) ਪੰਜਾਬੀ (Punjabi) Polski (Polish) Português (Portuguese) Română (Romanian) Русский (Russian) Svenska (Swedish) తెలుగు (Telugu) ภาษาไทย (Thai) Tagalog (Tagalog) Türkçe (Turkish) Українська 